        "original_id": "f4ce0799-3528-5623-8143-3895509a7ac8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Viva, Ainslee's Magazine, Redbook, The Lingerie Book, Mr. Mike's Mondo Video\n- People: Patty Oja, Mitchell Gray\n- Topics: Magazines, literary periodicals, film appearances, publication dates\n\nFacts:\n- Ainslee's Magazine was an American literary periodical published from 1897 to December 1926.\n- Viva was an adult woman's magazine that premiered in 1973 and ceased publication in 1980.\n- Patty Oja appeared in the film Mr. Mike's Mondo Video.\n- Patty Oja appeared in Redbook magazine and Viva magazine.\n- Patty Oja appeared on the cover of Mitchell Gray's The Lingerie Book.",
